---
const methods = [
  { label: "Bre-B", value: "@kevin1060", copy: "@kevin1060" },
  { label: "Nequi", value: "301 391 6533", copy: "3013916533" },
];
---

<section id="apoyo" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-28">
  <div class="reveal glow-border card-border overflow-hidden rounded-3xl">
    <div class="grid gap-10 p-10 sm:p-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan">Código abierto y gratis</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
          ¿Te sirvió <span class="text-gradient">Karina</span>?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted">
          La desarrollo y mantengo en mi tiempo libre, sin cobrar nada por la app.
          Si te evitó un susto con tus límites de IA, una donación —del monto que sea— ayuda a seguirla mejorando.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
          {methods.map((m) => (
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface px-4 py-3">
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">{m.label}</p>
                <p class="font-mono text-sm text-text">{m.value}</p>
              </div>
              <button
                type="button"
                data-copy={m.copy}
                class="copy-btn shrink-0 rounded-full border border-border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-muted transition-colors hover:border-white/25 hover:text-text"
              >
                Copiar
              </button>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 text-center">
          <img src="/qr-brebb.png" alt="Código QR Bre-B para donar a @kevin1060" class="mx-auto h-56 w-56 rounded-lg bg-white p-2 sm:h-64 sm:w-64" />
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-text">Escanea para donar por Bre-B</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted">@kevin1060</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".copy-btn").forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const text = btn.dataset.copy ?? "";
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        const original = btn.textContent;
        btn.textContent = "¡Copiado!";
        btn.classList.add("text-cyan", "border-cyan/40");
        setTimeout(() => {
          btn.textContent = original;
          btn.classList.remove("text-cyan", "border-cyan/40");
        }, 1600);
      } catch {
        /* clipboard unavailable, ignore */
      }
    });
  });
</script>
